---
// Sustainability.astro
// Section id: #sustainability
// JS binds to: #sustainability-hero, #sustainability-hero-inner,
// #sustainability-tagline, #sustainability-title, #sustainability-title-pre,
// #sustainability-title-main, #sustainability-desc,
// #sustainability-items, .sustainability-item, .sustainability-item-num,
// #sustainability-rive-canvas-harvesting, #sustainability-rive-canvas-text.
// All ids, classes, and data-* attributes are preserved verbatim.
---

<div id="sustainability" class="section">
  <div class="section__inner o-container">

    <!-- Hero text block -->
    <div id="sustainability-hero">
      <div id="sustainability-hero-inner">
        <div id="sustainability-tagline" class="sub2">UNSW Software Engineering (Honours) · WAM 83.1</div>
        <div id="sustainability-title">
          <h4 id="sustainability-title-pre">PRODUCT · AI · CLOUD</h4>
          <h2 id="sustainability-title-main">how I work</h2>
        </div>
        <div id="sustainability-desc" class="body2">
          One app shipped solo this year, on both stores.
          <br>I direct agents at scale.
          <br>I decide what ships,
          <br>and I read what they write.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Three stat items -->
    <div id="sustainability-items" class="o-grid">

      <div class="sustainability-item">
        <h3 class="sustainability-item-title">THE WHOLE<br />PRODUCT</h3>
        <div class="sustainability-item-desc body2">
           The app, the marketing site, the store listings, the films, the legal pages,
           the release process. SportLogic Play went from a stalled prototype to both
           app stores in two months with one engineer.
        </div>
        <div class="sustainability-item-num">1</div>
      </div>

      <div class="sustainability-item">
        <h4 class="sustainability-item-title">Agents <br />at scale</h4>
        <div class="sustainability-item-desc body2">
          35 billion tokens in the past 30 days, kept honest by 1,000 tests, golden sets
          of real data and audits of the live system. The XSS in generated code never shipped.
        </div>
        <canvas id="sustainability-rive-canvas-harvesting"></canvas>
      </div>

      <div class="sustainability-item">
        <h4 class="sustainability-item-title">NEW STACK, <br />ONE TERM.</h4>
        <div class="sustainability-item-desc body2">
           Joined Sunswift new to Flutter and to cars. Seven centre-display screens,
           navigation and a voice assistant by the end of the term. Now leading five
           software projects on SR8.
        </div>
        <canvas id="sustainability-rive-canvas-text"></canvas>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>
